# The forest spider's body (#328, D101, D102): the `dead` frame of spider.grid, pixel for pixel, in a decor-tier palette (D76):
# muted plum-grey with a contour in its own hue, no ink 0b0814, no moon rim, so a harmless body never reads as a live spider.
# Night palette (D92): the spider's own hues mixed toward the background 2c3f66 and greyed; keep it in step with spider.grid.
size 32 16
color k 58505a
color a 5c5460
color b 645a66
color c 6a606a
color h 685e68
color H 6e646c
color f 7c7676
color l 706c66
color L 78726a
color n 6c6862
frame body
